#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:3 e1a09ee28d494329b1d3a2eaddc726d5
msgid "Link Management"
msgstr "链路管理"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:5 5d0ba3d9fdba46438c7a52117884733e
msgid ""
"The link module allows the user to add, remove and monitor the status of "
"communications links to the APM. This can be done at any time."
msgstr "link 模块允许用户随时添加、删除和监控与 APM 之间通信链路的状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:8 5cf2d7273e6a4723af43d81783b3bf97
msgid ""
"It is useful for UAV systems that have multiple communications links. "
"MAVProxy will automatically read the data from both links, no user "
"intervention is necessary for link failover."
msgstr "该模块适用于具有多条通信链路的无人机系统。MAVProxy 将自动读取两条链路的数据，链路故障转移无需用户干预。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:12 826981781c164bdcada2d80569f47012
msgid "A link menu is available on the GUI console."
msgstr "图形控制台上提供链路菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:14 9aa6a26a0cd941e6a5979862fba4f3b6
msgid "For ease of management, links can have labels."
msgstr "为便于管理，链路可设置标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:17 f96b5b247e4f432b98e7ab48a905c7dc
msgid "link add"
msgstr "link add"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:19 52dfcb35b8ea471abfe537609ddb28a4
msgid ""
"Add an additional communications link. This can be either a network address "
"or serial port. For a serial port, the default baud rate is 57600. Use ``set"
" baudrate xxx`` to change baud rate for any subsequent link add's."
msgstr ""
"添加额外通信链路，可为网络地址或串口。串口默认波特率为 57600。使用 ``set baudrate xxx`` 更改后续添加链路的波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:24 09062533c488489585b971b9b6020762
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To add a label to a link, use ``:{\"label\":\"LinkName\"}`` after the link "
"details. Note the link label must not have any spaces in it."
msgstr "要为链路添加标签，请在链路详情后添加 ``:{\"label\":\"LinkName\"}``。注意链路标签不能包含空格。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:35 8cf65927787e454eaaa6bbc988e8c63a
msgid ""
"See the startup :ref:`section <mavproxy-quickstart>`  for full details on "
"link types"
msgstr "链路类型的完整说明请参阅启动 :ref:`章节 <mavproxy-quickstart>`"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:38 8c73ef8f34b443fa83174992e63cc951
msgid "link remove"
msgstr "link remove"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:40 504831b04e5d4e7c852517f144495c94
msgid ""
"Remove a communications link. The ID or label of the link is used to "
"identify the link to remove."
msgstr "删除通信链路，使用链路的 ID 或标签标识要删除的链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:49 8eb9a9ddf5784bf38b5ddf427aa55008
msgid "link list"
msgstr "link list"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:51 c45228b47007485eb318adbe8234deec
msgid ""
"List the active communications links, their ID's and labels (if applicable)."
msgstr "列出活动通信链路、其 ID 及标签（如适用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:58 c60ea12b6cf74965802db229052c1ba7
msgid "link dataratelogging"
msgstr "link dataratelogging"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:60 21f307a3e373458f8f379c335e8e7e4b
msgid ""
"Start or stop datarate statistic logging. If active, the statistics are "
"saved in \"dataratelog.csv\" in the same folder as the tlog."
msgstr "启动或停止数据速率统计日志记录。启用后，统计数据将保存在与 tlog 同一文件夹中的 「dataratelog.csv」 文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/link.rst:63 1b2f211508c14c3183e1dbec9cafffe9
msgid ""
"The statistics are useful for profiling and testing low-bandwidth datalinks."
msgstr "该统计数据用于分析和测试低带宽数据链路。"
